     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet DurchgefuehrteAbgabeStatusVS</b></p><a name=\"DurchgefuehrteAbgabeStatusVS\"> </a><a name=\"hcDurchgefuehrteAbgabeStatusVS\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-medicationdispense-status.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 5.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?5.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-medicationdispense-status.html#medicationdispense-status-completed\">completed</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Completed</td><td>The dispensed product has been picked up.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-medicationdispense-status.html#medicationdispense-status-entered-in-error\">entered-in-error</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Entered in Error</td><td>The dispense was entered in error and therefore nullified.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-medicationdispense-status.html#medicationdispense-status-cancelled\">cancelled</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Cancelled</td><td>The dispensed product was not and will never be picked up by the patient.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
